- `jasmine-logo_redraw.svg`
- `jasmine-logo_redraw.png` (512 px preview)
- `jasmine-logo_redraw-48.png` (native 48 px)

As asked, nothing is registered under `icon_set/model/icons`, `published/` is untouched, and I ran no build or gallery update.

